      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Floodwood’s economy shifted to dairy in 1911 when the Floodwood Creamery Cooperative opened, supplying milk worldwide until its late‑1960s closure.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
