      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Floodwood%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The city sits at the junction where the Floodwood, East Savanna, and Saint Louis rivers meet, a spot once vital for fur traders.",
